# Keep the build context small so `docker build` uploads seconds, not minutes.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Local build artefacts and test output
**/TestResults/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.log

# Repo dressing that has no business inside an image
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig
.claude/
docs/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE*

# Container files themselves — the daemon already has them
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml

# Non-target hosts and dev-only orchestration
src/samples/
